<p>Your quick wit and reflexes allow you to anticipate attacks against you, granting you a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100">32%, 34%, 35%, 36%, 37%</acronym> chance to evade melee and ranged attacks and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100">16, 27, 37, 46, 55</acronym> increased defense for 4 turns.</p><p>The chance to evade and defense bonus increase with your Dexterity.</p>